Build and run:
Requires gcc, make and the CUnit library (-lcunit) and optionally valgrind to build and run


make            # build all tests and the freq_count program
make test       # build and run all unit tests
make memetest   # run all unit tests under valgrind (reports errors and memory leaks)
make coverage   # run all unit tests and produces a coverage report for all the units tests in the terminal
make clean      # remove all build products


To run freq_count on one or more text files:
./freq_coount file1.txt file2.txt


